 "summary": "PMBT2222A is a single NPN bipolar transistor for switching and linear amplification, housed in the three-lead SOT23 (TO-236AB) surface-mount package. It carries up to 600 mA of continuous collector current (800 mA peak) and withstands 40 V collector to emitter with the base open. DC current gain is 100 to 300 at 150 mA and 10 V. The part is AEC-Q101 qualified for automotive use.",
